{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026W5PoaCxvAH1793700613.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Leslie 陳國賓在節目《流行都市》「睇餸食飯」環節中所教授的特色菜式——「宮保蝦丁生菜包」，這道菜口感豐富、清新開胃，非常適合與親友一同品嚐。</p><p></p><h3>宮保蝦丁生菜包</h3><h4>材料</h4><ul><li><p>花竹蝦仁：8隻（去殼切粒）</p></li><li><p>直菇：1杯（切粒）</p></li><li><p>松子仁：1/3杯（切碎）</p></li><li><p>酸蘿蔔：60克（切碎）</p></li><li><p>日式小蝦米：2湯匙</p></li><li><p>粟米仔：4條（切粒）</p></li><li><p>蒜頭：2粒（切片）</p></li><li><p>薑米：1湯匙</p></li><li><p>羅馬生菜葉：12片</p></li><li><p>梨：半隻（切粒）</p></li></ul><h4>調味</h4><ul><li><p>生抽：1湯匙</p></li><li><p>鹽：1/4茶匙</p></li><li><p>胡椒粉：少許</p></li><li><p>紹酒：2湯匙</p></li><li><p>花椒油：1湯匙</p></li><li><p>辣椒油：1湯匙</p></li><li><p>生粉水：適量</p></li></ul><h4>做法</h4><ol><li><p>燒熱白鍋，炒香直菇粒備用。</p></li><li><p>起油鍋，下薑米、蒜片、辣椒碎爆香，放入蝦仁炒熟後灒入紹酒，然後下粟米仔兜炒。</p></li><li><p>將直菇粒回鍋同炒，下胡椒粉、鹽、生抽調味。</p></li><li><p>拌入酸蘿蔔粒、松子仁略炒，注入生粉水埋芡後盛起裝碗。</p></li><li><p>拌入梨、日式小蝦米、花椒油成餡料後置碟即成。食用時以羅馬生菜葉包裹品嚐。</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"dcc6af6e-987d-4e03-8a87-df41216d46ac.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026mNrkdtpgXH1793700613.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:45:20.462060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":387,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T01:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.143177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T01:38:39.323839+00:00","content_hash":"a0d140648668b31aa9599391cffa3d9ddb674e90735c82a149998c4e6a6c7df7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T01:45:20.462060+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}